   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\">請各位大神幫忙，主要是兩大題，這裡先給大家看題目（各位大大看完題目後有</font><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:微軟正黑體;font-size:small\">分隔線，分隔線後是我的想法&gt;&lt;）</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">請讀取</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">S&amp;P500</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">資料檔。此為</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">S&amp;P500</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">報酬率的資料。請畫出</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">S&amp;P500</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">報酬率</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">的走勢圖。橫軸為日</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">期</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">，縱軸為報酬率。</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-FHTI_NDJ42g/WvigXAYFCII/AAAAAAAAC-k/SbQhVomarTsSi4NHSsX92Zl1gQlTM_seACLcBGAs/s1600/%25E8%259E%25A2%25E5%25B9%2595%25E5%25BF%25AB%25E7%2585%25A7%2B2018-05-14%2B%25E4%25B8%258A%25E5%258D%25883.57.09.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-FHTI_NDJ42g/WvigXAYFCII/AAAAAAAAC-k/SbQhVomarTsSi4NHSsX92Zl1gQlTM_seACLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E8%25259E%2525A2%2525E5%2525B9%252595%2525E5%2525BF%2525AB%2525E7%252585%2525A7%252B2018-05-14%252B%2525E4%2525B8%25258A%2525E5%25258D%2525883.57.09.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237462233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3e3uQ3uX2py6YNlLndcTyB\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-FHTI_NDJ42g/WvigXAYFCII/AAAAAAAAC-k/SbQhVomarTsSi4NHSsX92Zl1gQlTM_seACLcBGAs/s320/%25E8%259E%25A2%25E5%25B9%2595%25E5%25BF%25AB%25E7%2585%25A7%2B2018-05-14%2B%25E4%25B8%258A%25E5%258D%25883.57.09.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"127\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_nuGppsRuXo/WvigcE5jq0I/AAAAAAAAC-o/hwILeiOuw8gkuTcR2xIaCbR_o_q4S8KRQCLcBGAs/s1600/%25E8%25B5%25B0%25E5%258B%25A2%25E5%259C%2596%25E7%2589%2587.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_nuGppsRuXo/WvigcE5jq0I/AAAAAAAAC-o/hwILeiOuw8gkuTcR2xIaCbR_o_q4S8KRQCLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E8%2525B5%2525B0%2525E5%25258B%2525A2%2525E5%25259C%252596%2525E7%252589%252587.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237462233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Dc39y5Fty445AWSfYYfNJ\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_nuGppsRuXo/WvigcE5jq0I/AAAAAAAAC-o/hwILeiOuw8gkuTcR2xIaCbR_o_q4S8KRQCLcBGAs/s320/%25E8%25B5%25B0%25E5%258B%25A2%25E5%259C%2596%25E7%2589%2587.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"182\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"> </span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">請寫一個自訂函數，函數名稱為</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">Moments</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">。</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">請將</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">S&amp;P500</span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">  報酬</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">率資料帶入</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">Moments</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">函數，並計算出</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">結果。</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">Moments</span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">  可讓使用者輸入報酬率資料，並輸出下列計算內容</span></font><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體;color:rgb(56,118,29);font-size:small;text-indent:0in\"> </span></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">      </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">(1)</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">報酬率的變異數   </span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">      </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">(2)</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">報酬率的最大值   </span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">      </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">(3)</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">報酬</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">率</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">的最小值   </span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">      </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">Note:</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">不可以使用下列</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">R</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">語言的內建函數</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">:</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"></span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">mean(), </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">var</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">(),</span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">                 max(), min()</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-faJnXVTMsZA/WvigkLgLOEI/AAAAAAAAC-s/70-k7OpQZwoEOdfbUtjUXK0mZCHRVWjIgCLcBGAs/s1600/%25E5%258E%259F%25E6%25AA%2594%25E9%2595%25B7%25E7%259B%25B8%2B%25E5%2585%25A9%25E5%2580%258B%25E8%25AE%258A%25E9%25A0%2585%2B%25E4%25B8%2580%25E7%25AD%2586numeric%2B%25E4%25B8%2580%25E7%25AD%2586factor.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-faJnXVTMsZA/WvigkLgLOEI/AAAAAAAAC-s/70-k7OpQZwoEOdfbUtjUXK0mZCHRVWjIgCLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E5%25258E%25259F%2525E6%2525AA%252594%2525E9%252595%2525B7%2525E7%25259B%2525B8%252B%2525E5%252585%2525A9%2525E5%252580%25258B%2525E8%2525AE%25258A%2525E9%2525A0%252585%252B%2525E4%2525B8%252580%2525E7%2525AD%252586numeric%252B%2525E4%2525B8%252580%2525E7%2525AD%252586factor.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237462233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3JX698v-W1kvlKtQiOK_3I\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-faJnXVTMsZA/WvigkLgLOEI/AAAAAAAAC-s/70-k7OpQZwoEOdfbUtjUXK0mZCHRVWjIgCLcBGAs/s320/%25E5%258E%259F%25E6%25AA%2594%25E9%2595%25B7%25E7%259B%25B8%2B%25E5%2585%25A9%25E5%2580%258B%25E8%25AE%258A%25E9%25A0%2585%2B%25E4%25B8%2580%25E7%25AD%2586numeric%2B%25E4%25B8%2580%25E7%25AD%2586factor.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"266\" height=\"320\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-hifMccBcmw8/Wvigob8VzoI/AAAAAAAAC-0/T7pfokJews8yT33BHCkPlRKoOg2_BjgzQCLcBGAs/s1600/%25E5%258E%259F%25E6%25AA%2594%25E7%259A%2584Str%25E8%25B7%259FClass.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-hifMccBcmw8/Wvigob8VzoI/AAAAAAAAC-0/T7pfokJews8yT33BHCkPlRKoOg2_BjgzQCLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E5%25258E%25259F%2525E6%2525AA%252594%2525E7%25259A%252584Str%2525E8%2525B7%25259FClass.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237462233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1G3K0gzH99IsYYgD0pigsb\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-hifMccBcmw8/Wvigob8VzoI/AAAAAAAAC-0/T7pfokJews8yT33BHCkPlRKoOg2_BjgzQCLcBGAs/s320/%25E5%258E%259F%25E6%25AA%2594%25E7%259A%2584Str%25E8%25B7%259FClass.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"58\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:微軟正黑體;font-size:small\">-----------------------------------------------</span><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:微軟正黑體;font-size:small\">然後我也有附程式碼、讀取檔案csv、資料大概長相圖、原檔class、str、我畫的走勢圖。</span><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">-----------------------------------------------</span></font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\" color=\"#0b5394\">第一大題，求各位大大教我怎麼畫包含「離散型資料與連續資料，並且2變項各不同資料型態」的走勢圖（折線圖）</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\" color=\"#0b5394\">以我這狀況來說，X軸是Factor（離散型，比方1～5，可是缺3)、Y軸是Numeric型態（最後則要生一個走勢）</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\" color=\"#0b5394\"><br></font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#0b5394\" face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\">我題目要求</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\" color=\"#0b5394\">x軸=Date（時間），y軸=SP500（報酬率）的走勢圖或折線圖</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\" color=\"#0b5394\">而我畫的圖（有附檔案給你們）可是畫出來很奇怪，似乎不是理想中模樣</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\" color=\"#0b5394\">照我查的資料來看，ggplot的方法，我的x軸（橫軸）的變項 ”Date“ 是factor而且是離散資料非連續，應該只要調整group=1就可以</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\" color=\"#0b5394\">可是畫出來還是殘念QQ</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\">這邊有我的code</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">sp500a&lt;- read.table(&quot;SP500.csv&quot;,header=TRUE,sep=&quot;,&quot;)</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">library(ggplot2)</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">＃上面的附圖顯示的是ggplot畫的</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">ggplot(sp500a, aes(group=1,x =Date, y =SP500)) + geom_line()+geom_point()+geom_smooth(method=&quot;loess&quot;,se=FALSE)</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">＃阿後來沒有用plot是因為畫出來後只有散佈圖的長相，可是我要的是走勢圖、折線圖的樣子</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">但是各位大大要用plot教我也是可以&gt;&lt;</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">plot(sp500a,type = &quot;l&quot;, col = &quot;red&quot;, xlab = &quot;Date&quot;, ylab = &quot;SP500&quot;,main = &quot;sp500 chart&quot;)</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#0b5394\">第二大題</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#0b5394\">要算Y軸的變異數、最大值、最小值，可是這邊對我來講困難的是</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#0b5394\">不能用內建Var()、Max()、Min（），而是要自訂一個函數來計算Ｙ<span style=\"text-indent:0in\">軸=SP500（報酬率）的</span></font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"text-indent:0in\"><font color=\"#0b5394\">變異數、最大值、最小值</font></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"text-indent:0in\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">變異數是“標準差”的平方</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">再來的話，像</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">最大值不能用內建函數的話，我不太懂</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">因為這很直觀，而它還能再改為其他數學做法嗎？</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">難道是土法煉鋼，</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">先找到Ｙ軸<span style=\"text-indent:0in\">（報酬率）最大的，然後每一個數跟那個「最大值」邏輯判定</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">最後，「x＝最大值」才印來</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">可是這樣我仍然要先找最大值，還是等於先用了內建QQ所以我只想到這麼爛的方法，我自己都看不下去拉哈哈</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">請各位大大幫忙，要自訂函數的話</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"text-indent:0in\">到底怎麼怎麼做出變異數、最大值、最小值</span><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">希望能夠附上程式碼，因為我的R語言還不熟...&gt;&lt;</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "Ut9OKWZABgAJ",
