    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\">請各位大神幫忙，主要是兩大題，這裡先給大家看題目（各位大大看完題目後有</font><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:微軟正黑體;font-size:small\">分隔線，分隔線後是我的想法&gt;&lt;）</span></p></div></blockquote><div> </div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">請讀取</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">S&amp;P500</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">資料檔。此為</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">S&amp;P500</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">報酬率的資料。請畫出</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">S&amp;P500</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">報酬率</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">的走勢圖。橫軸為日</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">期</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">，縱軸為報酬率。</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-FHTI_NDJ42g/WvigXAYFCII/AAAAAAAAC-k/SbQhVomarTsSi4NHSsX92Zl1gQlTM_seACLcBGAs/s1600/%25E8%259E%25A2%25E5%25B9%2595%25E5%25BF%25AB%25E7%2585%25A7%2B2018-05-14%2B%25E4%25B8%258A%25E5%258D%25883.57.09.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-FHTI_NDJ42g/WvigXAYFCII/AAAAAAAAC-k/SbQhVomarTsSi4NHSsX92Zl1gQlTM_seACLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E8%25259E%2525A2%2525E5%2525B9%252595%2525E5%2525BF%2525AB%2525E7%252585%2525A7%252B2018-05-14%252B%2525E4%2525B8%25258A%2525E5%25258D%2525883.57.09.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237462239000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0eyl67hHJJhowfDAdbXrAW\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-FHTI_NDJ42g/WvigXAYFCII/AAAAAAAAC-k/SbQhVomarTsSi4NHSsX92Zl1gQlTM_seACLcBGAs/s320/%25E8%259E%25A2%25E5%25B9%2595%25E5%25BF%25AB%25E7%2585%25A7%2B2018-05-14%2B%25E4%25B8%258A%25E5%258D%25883.57.09.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"127\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_nuGppsRuXo/WvigcE5jq0I/AAAAAAAAC-o/hwILeiOuw8gkuTcR2xIaCbR_o_q4S8KRQCLcBGAs/s1600/%25E8%25B5%25B0%25E5%258B%25A2%25E5%259C%2596%25E7%2589%2587.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_nuGppsRuXo/WvigcE5jq0I/AAAAAAAAC-o/hwILeiOuw8gkuTcR2xIaCbR_o_q4S8KRQCLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E8%2525B5%2525B0%2525E5%25258B%2525A2%2525E5%25259C%252596%2525E7%252589%252587.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237462239000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3SXlvq8R6pZfP50jo-FJw1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_nuGppsRuXo/WvigcE5jq0I/AAAAAAAAC-o/hwILeiOuw8gkuTcR2xIaCbR_o_q4S8KRQCLcBGAs/s320/%25E8%25B5%25B0%25E5%258B%25A2%25E5%259C%2596%25E7%2589%2587.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"182\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"> </span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">請寫一個自訂函數，函數名稱為</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">Moments</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">。</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">請將</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">S&amp;P500</span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">  報酬</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">率資料帶入</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">Moments</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">函數，並計算出</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">結果。</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">Moments</span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">  可讓使用者輸入報酬率資料，並輸出下列計算內容</span></font><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體;color:rgb(56,118,29);font-size:small;text-indent:0in\"> </span></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">      </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">(1)</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">報酬率的變異數   </span></font></p></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
