     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:微軟正黑體\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:微軟正黑體\">      </span><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:微軟正黑體\">(2)</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"><font color=\"#38761d\">報酬率的最大值   (</font><font color=\"#990000\">更新:  這裡我突然想到</font><font color=\"#38761d\">，是不是可以用</font></span></font><span style=\"background-color:initial;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">order</span><span style=\"background-color:initial;color:inherit;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre;letter-spacing:0.2px\">(sp500a$SP500.Length,</span><span style=\"background-color:initial;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:rgb(144,32,0)\">decreasing =</span><span style=\"background-color:initial;color:inherit;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre;letter-spacing:0.2px\"> T)    )</span></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:微軟正黑體\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:微軟正黑體\">      </span><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:微軟正黑體\">(3)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:微軟正黑體\">報酬</span><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:微軟正黑體\">率</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"><font color=\"#38761d\">的最小值   (</font><font color=\"#990000\">更新: 這裡是不是可以用   </font></span></font><span style=\"background-color:initial;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">order</span><span style=\"background-color:initial;color:inherit;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre;letter-spacing:0.2px\">(sp500a$SP500.Length)     )</span></p></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">      </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">Note:</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">不可以使用下列</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">R</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">語言的內建函數</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">:</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"></span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">mean(), </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">var</span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">(),</span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">                 max(), min()</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-faJnXVTMsZA/WvigkLgLOEI/AAAAAAAAC-s/70-k7OpQZwoEOdfbUtjUXK0mZCHRVWjIgCLcBGAs/s1600/%25E5%258E%259F%25E6%25AA%2594%25E9%2595%25B7%25E7%259B%25B8%2B%25E5%2585%25A9%25E5%2580%258B%25E8%25AE%258A%25E9%25A0%2585%2B%25E4%25B8%2580%25E7%25AD%2586numeric%2B%25E4%25B8%2580%25E7%25AD%2586factor.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-faJnXVTMsZA/WvigkLgLOEI/AAAAAAAAC-s/70-k7OpQZwoEOdfbUtjUXK0mZCHRVWjIgCLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E5%25258E%25259F%2525E6%2525AA%252594%2525E9%252595%2525B7%2525E7%25259B%2525B8%252B%2525E5%252585%2525A9%2525E5%252580%25258B%2525E8%2525AE%25258A%2525E9%2525A0%252585%252B%2525E4%2525B8%252580%2525E7%2525AD%252586numeric%252B%2525E4%2525B8%252580%2525E7%2525AD%252586factor.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237462239000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ON0UmesDGFHLtcXr9cNZD\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-faJnXVTMsZA/WvigkLgLOEI/AAAAAAAAC-s/70-k7OpQZwoEOdfbUtjUXK0mZCHRVWjIgCLcBGAs/s320/%25E5%258E%259F%25E6%25AA%2594%25E9%2595%25B7%25E7%259B%25B8%2B%25E5%2585%25A9%25E5%2580%258B%25E8%25AE%258A%25E9%25A0%2585%2B%25E4%25B8%2580%25E7%25AD%2586numeric%2B%25E4%25B8%2580%25E7%25AD%2586factor.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"266\" height=\"320\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-hifMccBcmw8/Wvigob8VzoI/AAAAAAAAC-0/T7pfokJews8yT33BHCkPlRKoOg2_BjgzQCLcBGAs/s1600/%25E5%258E%259F%25E6%25AA%2594%25E7%259A%2584Str%25E8%25B7%259FClass.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-hifMccBcmw8/Wvigob8VzoI/AAAAAAAAC-0/T7pfokJews8yT33BHCkPlRKoOg2_BjgzQCLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E5%25258E%25259F%2525E6%2525AA%252594%2525E7%25259A%252584Str%2525E8%2525B7%25259FClass.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237462239000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26dvUuUqymy5L3XNHVsDnP\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-hifMccBcmw8/Wvigob8VzoI/AAAAAAAAC-0/T7pfokJews8yT33BHCkPlRKoOg2_BjgzQCLcBGAs/s320/%25E5%258E%259F%25E6%25AA%2594%25E7%259A%2584Str%25E8%25B7%259FClass.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"58\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:微軟正黑體;font-size:small\">-----------------------------------------------</span><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:微軟正黑體;font-size:small\">然後我也有附程式碼、讀取檔案csv、資料大概長相圖、原檔class、str、我畫的走勢圖。</span><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard;text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體\">-----------------------------------------------</span></font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\" color=\"#0b5394\">第一大題，求各位大大教我怎麼畫包含「離散型資料與連續資料，並且2變項各不同資料型態」的走勢圖（折線圖）</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\" color=\"#0b5394\">以我這狀況來說，X軸是Factor（離散型，比方1～5，可是缺3)、Y軸是Numeric型態（最後則要生一個走勢）</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\" color=\"#0b5394\"><br></font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#0b5394\" face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\">我題目要求</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\" color=\"#0b5394\">x軸=Date（時間），y軸=SP500（報酬率）的走勢圖或折線圖</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\" color=\"#0b5394\">而我畫的圖（有附檔案給你們）可是畫出來很奇怪，似乎不是理想中模樣</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\" color=\"#0b5394\">照我查的資料來看，ggplot的方法，我的x軸（橫軸）的變項 ”Date“ 是factor而且是離散資料非連續，應該只要調整group=1就可以</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\" color=\"#0b5394\">可是畫出來還是殘念QQ</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#38761d\" face=\"微軟正黑體\" size=\"2\">這邊有我的code</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">sp500a&lt;- read.table(&quot;SP500.csv&quot;,header=TRUE,sep=&quot;,&quot;)</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">library(ggplot2)</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">＃上面的附圖顯示的是ggplot畫的</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">ggplot(sp500a, aes(group=1,x =Date, y =SP500)) + geom_line()+geom_point()+geom_smooth(method=&quot;loess&quot;,se=FALSE)</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">＃阿後來沒有用plot是因為畫出來後只有散佈圖的長相，可是我要的是走勢圖、折線圖的樣子</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">但是各位大大要用plot教我也是可以&gt;&lt;</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">plot(sp500a,type = &quot;l&quot;, col = &quot;red&quot;, xlab = &quot;Date&quot;, ylab = &quot;SP500&quot;,main = &quot;sp500 chart&quot;)</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#0b5394\">第二大題</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#0b5394\">要算Y軸的變異數、最大值、最小值，可是這邊對我來講困難的是</font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><font color=\"#0b5394\">不能用內建Var()、Max()、Min（），而是要自訂一個函數來計算Ｙ<span style=\"text-indent:0in\">軸=SP500（報酬率）的</span></font></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"text-indent:0in\"><font color=\"#0b5394\">變異數、最大值、最小值</font></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"text-indent:0in\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">變異數是“標準差”的平方</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">再來的話，像</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">最大值不能用內建函數的話，我不太懂</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">因為這很直觀，而它還能再改為其他數學做法嗎？</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">難道是土法煉鋼，</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">先找到Ｙ軸<span style=\"text-indent:0in\">（報酬率）最大的，然後每一個數跟那個「最大值」邏輯判定</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">最後，「x＝最大值」才印來</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">可是這樣我仍然要先找最大值，還是等於先用了內建QQ所以我只想到這麼爛的方法，我自己都看不下去拉哈哈</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">請各位大大幫忙，要自訂函數的話</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"text-indent:0in\">到底怎麼怎麼做出變異數、最大值、最小值</span><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\">希望能夠附上程式碼，因為我的R語言還不熟...&gt;&lt;</p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"text-indent:0in;margin-top:5.76pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0.04in;direction:ltr;word-break:normal\"><br></p></div></blockquote></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
